  "notes": [
    "Regular -AR verb with a spelling change: *c→qu* before *e*, to preserve the hard /k/ sound — affects the yo form of Pretérito Indefinido (*sequé*, not *secé*) and all of Subjuntivo Presente (*seque, seques...*)",
    "Same pattern as *buscar*, *tocar*, *comunicar*",
    "Past participle: *secado* (regular)",
    "Means \"to dry\" (something) — *secar la ropa* (to dry the clothes), *secar los platos* (to dry the dishes)",
    "The reflexive form *secarse* (\"to dry oneself/to become dry\") already exists in the vault as a separate verb",
    "Related: *seco/a* (dry, adj.), *secador* (hair dryer), *sequía* (drought)"
  ],
